## Tips

- Google groups data types into categories (Personal info, Financial info, etc.). Select only the categories that contain types listed above in "Data Types Collected."
- For Firebase Auth with email sign-in: select **Personal info → Email address**.
- For Firebase Auth with Google Sign-In: select **Personal info → Email address** and **Personal info → Name** (Google provides display name).
- If you use Firebase Analytics: select **App info and performance → Diagnostics** and **Device or other IDs**.
- If you use Firebase Crashlytics: select **App info and performance → Crash logs**.
{% if has_location | default(false) %}
- Location permissions detected: select **Location → {{ 'Precise location' if 'ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION' in permissions | default([]) else 'Approximate location' }}**.
{% endif %}
